00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.740
Joe Biden
Speaker 2: has quietly, almost

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:21.150
Speaker 1: completely ended the drone war
that has become essentially the status quo

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:28.119
