00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:09.840
of neoconservative republicanism for several
decades at this point in time.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:15.509
And if you think back, it sort of started
with Donald Trump saying that Iraq War, that

00:01:15.509 --> 00:01:16.979
was a disaster.

00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:19.450
Trump started with that,
Speaker 2: and it was

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:26.350
Speaker 1: always B.S.. Trump's initial political
constituency was heavily made up of people

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:31.460
who supported the Iraq War under George W.
Bush and admittedly, people who were sort

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.869
