00:01:40.969 --> 00:01:41.969
And so they bought it.

00:01:41.969 --> 00:01:43.689
They bought it hook, line and sinker.

00:01:43.689 --> 00:01:47.210
Trump and Republicans, now they're against
war.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:50.420
Then it went to well.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:57.100
The leftists who didn't like Hillary started
building on it with the Hillary stuff, and

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:02.959
the Hillary's going to start for war stuff,
and Donald Trump isn't going to do that.

00:02:02.959 --> 00:02:05.289
That became the story.

00:02:05.289 --> 00:02:10.979
And it mostly transitioned right into Joe
Biden's presidency with this idea that if

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:14.550
you reelect Donald Trump, he'll keep us out
of war.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:19.030
But if you elect Joe Biden, it means that
more wars are coming.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.030
Biden was going to go to war.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.590
I mean, I don't even remember now Biden was
going to go to war with North Korea

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:27.240
Speaker 2: and
Speaker 1: China and Iran and Russia and all

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.480
this different stuff now.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:33.420
I said at the time, I don't see any appetite
from Joe Biden for doing those things.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.970
Maybe I'll be proven wrong.

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:39.280
But there's another story here that's actually
what we're talking about today.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:45.691
One of Barack Obama's biggest foreign policy
sort of conflicts with my ideology, and I

00:02:45.691 --> 00:02:50.430
talked about this all all through the Obama
administration was the drone war.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.830
Trump continued the drone war massively.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:56.960
He didn't talk about it that much because
remember, it was killer who was going to do

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:59.760
the war and the bombings, not Trump.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:04.870
But Trump continued Barack Obama's drone war,
which was an escalation of George W. Bush's

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:05.870
drone war.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:10.770
Now, maybe Bush would have done more if the
technology had been more mature at the time.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.810
Barack Obama had the benefit of that.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:19.340
But now we have the reality, and the reality
is that Joe Biden has almost completely ended

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.300
the American drone war.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.750
Joe Biden's not really saying that much about
it.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.040
The White House isn't really saying that much
about it.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.040
Neither is corporate media.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:30.660
But it's a huge, massive story.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:38.260
There was that one strike during the the Afghanistan
withdrawal, which went horribly wrong, killed

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:39.260
civilians.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.470
Speaker 2: Just absolute
Speaker 1: disaster.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:48.680
But Joe Biden has almost completely halted
drone strikes and airstrikes in general.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:53.060
We have to call this what it is, which is
a foreign policy victory in my mind.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:59.120
And it's also a communications and PR failure
by being almost completely silent about it.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.970
Under Bush, we started droning.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.570
Barack Obama did even more.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:08.490
Donald Trump continued huge debate controversy.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:13.150
But then look at what Joe Biden has now done
enters office.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:19.569
First of all, sets up a system that requires
White House approval for any strike outside

00:04:19.569 --> 00:04:21.180
of a war zone.

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:25.770
And listen to these numbers in Donald Trump's
first 11 months in office.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:33.759
He did 6500 air and artillery strikes, per
Airwars, which tracks drone strikes in Iraq

00:04:33.759 --> 00:04:35.740
and Syria alone.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:44.599
Air Wars reports for under Joe Biden's first
11 months not 400, not 40 or 40.

00:04:44.599 --> 00:04:51.680
As Joe Biden says, just for four of them,
air strikes in Somalia, down 75 percent from

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.610
last year to fewer than 10.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:05:02.199
No civilian casualties in Yemen instead of
18 strikes last year, down to four.

00:05:02.199 --> 00:05:08.590
This is a massive change, but the real question
is why the Biden White House has been so quiet

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.680
about it.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:14.919
Is it because the Afghanistan air strike,
the drone strike went so wrong that they just

00:05:14.919 --> 00:05:19.129
don't even want to talk about the fact that
there is still some droning going on?

00:05:19.129 --> 00:05:25.979
Is it because it will lead to Joe Biden being
called weak by Republicans, which of course,

00:05:25.979 --> 00:05:28.330
remember under Trump?

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:32.939
Republicans claimed they are the ones who
don't want to do interventionist foreign policy

00:05:32.939 --> 00:05:35.659
strikes, war, etc.

00:05:35.659 --> 00:05:39.900
But at the same time, the Republican Party
has a long history of pointing to Democrats

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.401
and saying, Oh, you don't want to go to war,
you don't want to go to Iraq, you don't want

00:05:43.401 --> 00:05:46.509
to take this person out that well, then you're
actually the weak one.

00:05:46.509 --> 00:05:49.969
Is it a fear of that that's keeping the Biden
administration from

00:05:49.969 --> 00:05:53.699
Speaker 2: talking about this major
Speaker 1: accomplishment more?

00:05:53.699 --> 00:05:57.550
Is it because Joe Biden doesn't like to brag?

00:05:57.550 --> 00:06:01.840
I mean, a couple of people emailed means that
they said it's not Joe Biden.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:06.050
Constitutionally, Joe Biden doesn't like bragging,
and that's why he's not doing it.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.430
He's sort of he's bragged about vaccines.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.430
He's bragged about.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:10.900
I don't I don't think that that's it.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.620
So a few different things here, number one.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:19.960
Of course, there's the reality that sometimes
you're droning instead of sending in boots

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.270
